# Software

- Target Raspberry Pi OS 64-bit. Vision inference runs on Hailo (`hailo-all`), not as the default CPU YOLO path.
- Pi 5 has no analog headphone jack; audio I/O is USB or I2S.
- ROS 2 is optional later, not required for v1 behavior loop.
- Keep high-level behavior on the Pi; do not bit-bang 12 servos from Python in production.
- Record model names, input size, and Hailo HEF assumptions in docs when you add a pipeline.
